From 6a4a558e218563167f70a34a7884cf04f82112e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:31:47 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 14/32] kcm_baloofile: Form page (what to index), folder list
 on a Locations sub-page, indexer state loaded after the first frame
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md). Baloo settings, kcfg keys, filtered folder model, save() behaviour unchanged. Not built yet.

Moved / renamed:
- Main page is one FormLayout: "Data to index" radios (nothing / file names only / names and contents) first, "Also index
  hidden files and folders" indented under them and disabled (not hidden) with indexing off (kcm_baloofile/indexingEnabled,
  OnlyBasicIndexing, indexHiddenFolders). The intro paragraph above the form became a ContextualHelpButton.
- The Locations list (was an overlay-header list under the form) is a sub-page, Locations.qml, opened by "Folders to index:
  Choose Folders…". Start/Stop Indexing a Folder… are its page actions; the row delegate with Indexed/Not indexed combo
  and Remove entry is unchanged (kcm_baloofile/StartFolder, StopFolder, filteredModel-removeFolder).
- Indexer state/progress moved from the footer to a section "Indexer"; Pause/Resume Indexer from the toolbar to a button
  beside the state (kcm_baloofile/IndexerStatus, PauseResume). Delete Index Data message unchanged (DeleteIndex).
HIG ids: HIG-001/005/006 (order by use), HIG-057 (no Advanced; sub-page instead of a second list), button labels end with an
ellipsis when they open something.

Speed causes (kcms/baloo): (1) rawIndexFileSize()/prettyIndexFileSize() were evaluated in message bindings (stat of the
index at load); now read once after the first frame (Qt.callLater) and the text only built while the message shows.
(2) Baloo.Monitor (D-Bus client to baloo_file) was created with the page; it now lives in IndexerStatus.qml behind an
asynchronous Loader. (3) The folder list and its file dialog are only built when the sub-page opens.
After numbers: pending, manager will measure.

Unconfirmed: Loader sourceComponent with the sibling type IndexerStatus {} inside the qml module (same pattern as other sub
pages, not compiled); Locations.qml picked up by kcmutils_add_qml_kcm's ui/*.qml glob like keyboard's Hardware.qml.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
